["Physical"],"flavourText":"A basic guerilla fighter. After receiving tactical commands, they will gain increased capabilities and utilize a full range of offensive maneuvers.","abilities":["When Inspired, gains Movement Speed."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.1,"stats":{"hp":3300,"atk":300,"def":300,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"witchcraft_orb":{"slug":"witchcraft_orb","name":"Witchcraft Orb","icon":"/enemies-icons/Witchcraft Orb.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Stone spheres created by the Altar of Hatred. Sarkaz witchcraft has given them 'life,' yet they seek out the living so that they might perish together.","abilities":["Upon destruction, deals True damage and stuns all allied units in the surrounding area."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":3000,"atk":200,"def":200,"res":20,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2}},"infused_glacial_originium_slug_enemy_1067_snslime_2":{"slug":"infused_glacial_originium_slug_enemy_1067_snslime_2","name":"Infused Glacial Originium Slug α","icon":"/enemies-icons/Infused Glacial Originium Slug α.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Infected Creature","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An infected wild creature native to colder environments that has become unstable due to assimilating a large amount of Originium into its abdomen. More threatening than normal Infused Glacial Originium Slugs, they explode upon death, damaging and freezing nearby Operators. Due to their low intelligence, they are easily controlled by Yeti Squadron members for various tactical purposes.","abilities":["Upon death, deals Physical damage in an area and applies Cold to affected targets"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"sta